# Note: .maestro-space/ is TRACKED (per the restructure in PR
# "docs(maestro-space): restructure to tracked .maestro-space/ framework").
# The workflow-secrets subdirectory (.maestro-space/maestro-secrets/) is the only
# part of .maestro-space/ that remains ignored — that exclusion is enforced by
# .maestro-space/.gitignore (the internal defensive marker).
# docs/handoffs/ is no longer used; legacy framework artifacts now live under
# .maestro-space/maestro-works/<phase>/<task>/.
